{'symbol': 'JKHY', 'date': '2022-09-22 08:00:00', 'title': 'WOODSVILLE GUARANTY SAVINGS BANK COLLABORATES WITH JACK HENRY TO POSITION FOR FUTURE GROWTH', 'text': 'MODERN, OPEN TECHNOLOGY WILL HELP 133-YEAR-OLD BANK IMPROVE EFFICIENCIES AND USER EXPERIENCE MONETT, MO. , SEPT. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JACK HENRY™ (NASDAQ: JKHY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT WOODSVILLE GUARANTY SAVINGS BANK SELECTED JACK HENRY TO IMPROVE EFFICIENCIES AND USER EXPERIENCE FOR BOTH CUSTOMERS AND EMPLOYEES WHILE CONTINUING TO PROVIDE PERSONAL SERVICE AS THE BANK GROWS.'}